<div id="biobox">
	<h3>About the author</h3>
	<p><strong>Tyler Kalmakoff</strong> is a writer living in western Canada. A former college baseball player, Tyler walked away from Thompson Rivers University’s journalism program in Kamloops, British Columbia after nearly five years to begin a career in fiction writing. He now spends his days reading and writing with his cat, Roxy, always nearby. In his spare time he enjoys watching baseball and sitting high in the stands of turn one at the local speedway with his editor, shelling peanuts and picking winners. </p>
